  "reviewer_note": "Least sure: exact mutiny location (sources say near Tofua or near Tonga), launch length (23 vs 24 feet), and Bligh's Tahiti departure (4 vs 5 April 1789), which is not used. The path joins Bligh's launch and Christian's ship as two separate journeys. Route (2026-11-12): the line now ends at Kupang and follows Bligh's launch only. Christian's separate movements in the Bounty (Tubuai, Tahiti, Pitcairn) are shown as pulses, not joined to the launch's route.",
